    ],
    "text": "Clause 2: This clause amends section 2 of the Law Commission Act, No. 3 of 1969(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section asamended is to change the composition of the Law Commission.",
    "fonts": [
