    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      266.93,
      401.9,
      290.99
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      304.97,
      401.85,
      329.03
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Law Commission(Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      343.13,
      401.92,
      392.51
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Law Commission Act, No. 3 of 1969(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) as lastamended by Act, No. 11 of 1978 is hereby repealed and theas following section substituted therefor:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      215.85,
      406.61,
      401.88,
      443.27
    ],
    "text": "2. (1) There shall be established aCommission which shall be called the LawCommission, and which shall consist of\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      237.57,
      457.37,
      401.73,
      468.71
    ],
    "text": "(a)the following ex-officio members:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      263.85,
      482.81,
      401.88,
      544.91
    ],
    "text": "(i)the Secretary to the Ministryof the Minister assigned thesubject of Justice or hisnominee not below the rankof a Senior Assistant Secretary;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      260.85,
      559.01,
      401.86,
      608.39
    ],
    "text": "(ii)an officer not below the rankof an Additional Solicitor-General nominated by theAttorney-General; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      257.85,
      622.49,
      401.88,
      671.87
    ],
    "text": "(iii)the Legal Draftsman or hisnominee not below the rankof a Senior Assistant LegalDraftsman; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      343.15,
      454.29,
      381.02
    ],
    "text": "Replacementof section 2of Act, No. 3of 1969.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
