    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      167.17,
      339.32,
      178.24
    ],
    "text": "Law Commission (Amendment)2",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      232.87,
      202.73,
      397.19,
      342.83
    ],
    "text": "(b)not less than ten and not more thanfourteen other members appointedby the President (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cappointed member\u201d) fromamong persons appearing to thePresident to be suitably qualified forsuch appointment and the majorityof whom shall be persons who haveheld or hold judical office, or haveexperience as attorneys-at-law orteachers in law, or are academicallyqualified in law.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      354.89,
      397.18,
      389.63
    ],
    "text": "(2) The President shall appoint one of themembers of the Commission to be the Chairmanof the Commission.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      401.69,
      397.2,
      471.47
    ],
    "text": "(3) An appointed member shall, unless heearlier vacates his office, hold office for suchperiod, not exceeding five years, as may bedetermined by the President at the time of hisappointment, and shall be eligible forreappointment:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      483.53,
      397.2,
      553.43
    ],
    "text": "Provided, however, that if an appointedmember vacates his office prior to theexpiration of his term of office, his successorshall, unless he earlier vacates his office, holdoffice only for the unexpired portion of theterm of the member whom he succeeds.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      565.49,
      397.2,
      600.23
    ],
    "text": "(4) An appointed member may resign hisoffice by writing under his hand addressed tothe President.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      211.15,
      612.29,
      397.17,
      670.55
    ],
    "text": "(5) There shall be paid to the members ofthe Commission for their services suchremuneration as may be determined by theMinister, with the prior concurrence of theMinister assigned the subject of Finance.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
